# Integrate fetal ovary snRNA-seq with the selected adult ovary CELLxGENE reference.
#
# Integration uses:
#   - fetal RNA/data generated by LogNormalize
#   - adult RNA/data from CELLxGENE adata$X, already normalized/log-like
#   - gene-symbol intersection
#   - RPCA anchors
#   - Seurat IntegrateData
#
# RNA/counts layers are preserved for downstream pseudobulk analyses.

